1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,186
Every video comes with the same boring jobs.

2
00:00:03,506 --> 00:00:06,603
Timing the script. Checking if your title

3
00:00:06,603 --> 00:00:09,700
gets cut off. Making subtitles. Resizing the thumbnail.

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:14,308
And if you want a map animation, that's an afternoon in After Effects.

5
00:00:14,628 --> 00:00:17,732
Add it up, and it's hours, for every single upload.

6
00:00:18,932 --> 00:00:20,418
So I built Creator Bench.

7
00:00:20,738 --> 00:00:24,187
Fourteen free tools for creators, all in one place.

8
00:00:24,507 --> 00:00:29,183
No sign-up. Nothing gets uploaded. It all runs right in your browser.

9
00:00:29,503 --> 00:00:31,025
Let me show you every tool.

10
00:00:32,225 --> 00:00:35,303
Let's start with my favourite, the Map Route Animator.

11
00:00:35,623 --> 00:00:39,910
Type the places in order. Cities work, and so do whole countries.

12
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:44,926
For each stop, pick how you travelled. Plane, train, car, ship, or on foot.

13
00:00:46,126 --> 00:00:47,179
Then pick a look.

14
00:00:47,499 --> 00:00:51,399
There's explainer paper, vintage atlas, blueprint, night mode,

15
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:55,299
and a satellite style that uses real NASA imagery.

16
00:00:56,499 --> 00:00:59,472
Turn on the globe intro, and your video opens

17
00:00:59,472 --> 00:01:02,446
on a spinning Earth that zooms into your first stop.

18
00:01:02,766 --> 00:01:07,312
Press play, and the route draws itself, highlighting every country on the way.

19
00:01:08,512 --> 00:01:13,080
Choose sixteen by nine for YouTube, or vertical for Reels and Shorts.

20
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,173
Then hit export. You get a video file with no watermark.

21
00:01:18,373 --> 00:01:22,097
Script Timer tells you how long your script takes to read out loud.

22
00:01:22,417 --> 00:01:24,660
Paste it in and pick your speaking pace.

23
00:01:24,980 --> 00:01:28,825
You get the total length, plus a timestamp for every paragraph.

24
00:01:30,025 --> 00:01:33,939
Title Preview shows your title and thumbnail the way viewers see them.

25
00:01:34,259 --> 00:01:37,536
On the home feed, in search, and in the sidebar,

26
00:01:37,536 --> 00:01:40,813
so you can spot exactly where your title gets cut off.

27
00:01:42,013 --> 00:01:47,283
Safe Zones lays the TikTok, Reels and Shorts buttons over your vertical video.

28
00:01:47,603 --> 00:01:49,999
So your text never hides behind them.

29
00:01:51,199 --> 00:01:53,870
Frame Extractor pulls frames out of any video.

30
00:01:54,190 --> 00:01:57,614
Grab the exact frame you need, or extract a whole

31
00:01:57,614 --> 00:02:01,037
set and download it as a zip. Perfect for thumbnails.

32
00:02:02,237 --> 00:02:05,812
The Earnings Calculator estimates what your views could earn.

33
00:02:06,132 --> 00:02:09,298
It adjusts for your niche, and for where your viewers live.

34
00:02:10,498 --> 00:02:14,531
Image Resizer gives you the exact size for every platform.

35
00:02:14,851 --> 00:02:18,476
YouTube thumbnails, Instagram posts, Shorts covers. And it

36
00:02:18,476 --> 00:02:22,102
can compress your image under any file size limit.

37
00:02:23,302 --> 00:02:26,682
Caption Formatter keeps your line breaks on Instagram.

38
00:02:27,002 --> 00:02:31,533
It moves hashtags to the end, removes duplicates, and checks every limit.

39
00:02:32,733 --> 00:02:36,404
YouTube Chapters builds timestamps from your section lengths.

40
00:02:36,724 --> 00:02:39,727
Or paste your own, and it checks them

41
00:02:39,727 --> 00:02:42,731
against YouTube's rules, so your chapters actually show up.

42
00:02:43,931 --> 00:02:47,919
Text to SRT turns your script into a subtitle file.

43
00:02:48,239 --> 00:02:52,308
And if your subtitles are out of sync, it can shift them in seconds.

44
00:02:53,508 --> 00:02:56,572
Word Counter checks every platform limit as

45
00:02:56,572 --> 00:02:59,636
you type, from YouTube titles to TikTok captions.

46
00:03:00,836 --> 00:03:03,826
Case Converter switches between title case, upper

47
00:03:03,826 --> 00:03:06,815
case, sentence case and more, in one click.

48
00:03:08,015 --> 00:03:11,489
QR Code makes codes for links, text, or Wi-Fi.

49
00:03:11,809 --> 00:03:17,542
Download them as PNG or SVG. They never expire, and there's no sign-up.

50
00:03:18,742 --> 00:03:22,978
And JPG to PDF turns your images into

51
00:03:22,978 --> 00:03:27,214
a PDF, or merges PDFs together, without uploading anything.

52
00:03:28,414 --> 00:03:30,010
That's all fourteen tools.

53
00:03:30,330 --> 00:03:35,326
Everything is free, there's no sign-up, and your files never leave your device.

54
00:03:35,646 --> 00:03:40,140
Try it at creatorbenchtool.com. The link is in the description.

55
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:43,744
And tell me in the comments, which tool should I build next?
